  "title": "Section 38 CPC — Which court executes",
  "jurisdiction": "India",
  "content": {
    "overview": "Execute in the court that passed the decree, or in the court to which it is sent.",
    "study": "Section 39 is the transfer. Section 38 is the fork. Do not file a fresh suit to collect a money decree.",
